{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"tavern","model_identifier":"tavern","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# tavern\n\nTavern (Patch 5): a two-storey black-and-white timber-framed inn. White plaster between near-black beams, the upper floor jettied out over the ground floor on black brackets, a steep red clay tile roof with two lit dormers, and a tall brick chimney on the right (+X) gable. A green double door with a lantern over it, green shutters, an inn sign with a gold tankard hanging from an iron bracket at the front-left corner, player-colour bunting, trestle tables, benches, barrels and a keg in front, and a lean-to woodshed at the back.\n\n- Footprint: 10 x 10 columns (160 x 160 units, 4.50 x 4.50 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -80..80, y 0..245, z -79..84 units (the woodshed eave reaches 3.5 u past the back edge; the chimney footing sinks 0.4 u).\n- Texture: 1024 x 1024, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: 336, all in `finished`; no hidden state sets (the game draws neither construction stages nor ruins for buildings).\n- Glowing parts: 16 lit windows `glow_window_*` (the \"open for business\" look; the game dims them when the tavern is closed) and `glow_lantern`.\n- Team colour (52, 96, 178): the sign's trim and the bunting pennants.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- house: 128 x 245 x 112 centred at x 0, z 4 (main block with the jetty and roof; the chimney stands inside it at x +70)\n- porch props are walk-through\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -56)\n- `fx_smoke` at (70.75, 245, 8): top of the chimney pot.\n- `fx_lantern` at (0, 61.8, -48.8): the lantern over the door.\n- `fx_window_1` to `fx_window_16`: the centre of each lit window pane, 1 u outside the glass, for the flicker and passing silhouettes when open. 1-3 front ground floor, 4-7 front upper floor, 8-9 the -X side, 10-11 the +X side, 12-14 the back, 15-16 the dormers."},"resolution":{"width":1024,"height":1024},"elements":[{"name":"cobble_plinth","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-67.5,0,-43.5],"to":[67.5,7,59.5],"autouv":0,"color":4,"origin":[0,3.5,8],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,464,135,471],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[132,471,235,478],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[135,464,270,471],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[235,471,338,478],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[408,0,543,103],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[543,0,678,103],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"9030443e-d934-e6c6-ab16-c03764125f31"},{"name":"plaster_wall_ground#f3efe6","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-64,4.7,-40],"to":[64,73.8,56],"autouv":0,"color":1,"origin":[0,39.5,8],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[624,169,752,238],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[880,169,976,238],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[752,169,880,238],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,260,96,329],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[714,0,842,96],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[842,0,970,96],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"c01262ea-598c-bf1d-bc18-82d9b474f9f4"},{"name":"plaster_wall_upper#f3efe6","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-63.8,72,-48],"to":[63.8,138,64],"autouv":0,"color":4,"origin":[0,105,8],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[352,260,480,326],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[608,260,720,326],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[480,260,608,326],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[720,260,832,326],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[84,0,212,112],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[212,0,340,112],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"39015edf-12dd-b753-4cd2-111461457b6a"},{"name":"beam_post_gf_corner_fl#2a201a","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope