]},{"uuid":"220d9e40-40be-65b7-bdd6-f46605c9754a","isOpen":false,"children":[]},{"uuid":"29542baf-271f-6a59-99d6-833c3f9c88b9","isOpen":false,"children":[]},{"uuid":"7a33986a-b924-33bd-0eed-59aa34859201","isOpen":false,"children":[]},{"uuid":"15658051-27c0-b1ab-86f7-67153341f5f1","isOpen":false,"children":[]},{"uuid":"9a7c19ca-9095-b193-2831-a4cf35fe9431","isOpen":false,"children":[]},{"uuid":"2b46cad9-e0a6-ee8f-e8f3-34437db86e8f","isOpen":false,"children":[]},{"uuid":"4ff7c4bb-c22b-8b89-4e8d-5c48c825c322","isOpen":false,"children":[]},{"uuid":"55cc87ac-eb0b-102b-b075-651f87bc5143","isOpen":false,"children":[]},{"uuid":"8fb90676-039f-2461-4c29-e115a54dcd44","isOpen":false,"children":[]},{"uuid":"767fca77-0d05-d346-7838-30e7c49bcd82","isOpen":false,"children":[]},{"uuid":"e8337dfa-cfe9-40ed-2aa5-97b1f9c5b12a","isOpen":false,"children":[]},{"uuid":"da4a648b-a66f-8458-19ee-3e4a081f411f","isOpen":false,"children":[]},{"uuid":"de07f1ea-38a8-d412-f739-8f7d2dc0430d","isOpen":false,"children":[]},{"uuid":"2d2af177-e55f-4310-53e0-28edcd44b09b","isOpen":false,"children":[]},{"uuid":"f3fdc451-142f-f748-e46c-e07ffc730084","isOpen":false,"children":[]},{"uuid":"e22cda9b-2177-7090-7acb-21c940245352","isOpen":false,"children":[]},{"uuid":"eb051b6f-a5ad-5495-ad91-d14ff821f681","isOpen":false,"children":[]},{"uuid":"9ffe624a-fcba-4c31-55b2-361f55dfab92","isOpen":false,"children":[]},{"uuid":"aba149f7-b4a9-7620-3f21-8c75cced7579","isOpen":false,"children":[]}]}],"textures":[{"name":"tavern.png","path":"","folder":"","namespace":"","id":"0","group":"","scope":0,"width":1024,"height":1024,"uv_width":1024,"uv_height":1024,"particle":false,"use_as_default":false,"layers_enabled":false,"sync_to_project":"","file_format":"png","render_mode":"default","render_sides":"auto","wrap_mode":"limited","pbr_channel":"color","fps":7,"frame_time":1,"frame_order_type":"loop","frame_order":"","frame_interpolate":false,"visible":true,"internal":true,"saved":true,"uuid":"008b9b6b-ab3a-cc4d-e584-f9780aa3a7c7","source":"data:image/png;base64,","relative_path":""}],"description":"# tavern\n\nTavern (Patch 5): a two-storey black-and-white timber-framed inn. White plaster between near-black beams, the upper floor jettied out over the ground floor on black brackets, a steep red clay tile roof with two lit dormers, and a tall brick chimney on the right (+X) gable. A green double door with a lantern over it, green shutters, an inn sign with a gold tankard hanging from an iron bracket at the front-left corner, player-colour bunting, trestle tables, benches, barrels and a keg in front, and a lean-to woodshed at the back.\n\n- Footprint: 10 x 10 columns (160 x 160 units, 4.50 x 4.50 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -80..80, y 0..245, z -79..84 units (the woodshed eave reaches 3.5 u past the back edge; the chimney footing sinks 0.4 u).\n- Texture: 1024 x 1024, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: 336, all in `finished`; no hidden state sets (the game draws neither construction stages nor ruins for buildings).\n- Glowing parts: 16 lit windows `glow_window_*` (the \"open for business\" look; the game dims them when the tavern is closed) and `glow_lantern`.\n- Team colour (52, 96, 178): the sign's trim and the bunting pennants.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- house: 128 x 245 x 112 centred at x 0, z 4 (main block with the jetty and roof; the chimney stands inside it at x +70)\n- porch props are walk-through\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -56)\n- `fx_smoke` at (70.75, 245, 8): top of the chimney pot.\n- `fx_lantern` at (0, 61.8, -48.8): the lantern over the door.\n- `fx_window_1` to `fx_window_16`: the centre of each lit window pane, 1 u outside the glass, for the flicker and passing silhouettes when open. 1-3 front ground floor, 4-7 front upper floor, 8-9 the -X side, 10-11 the +X side, 12-14 the back, 15-16 the dormers."}